# See docs/audits/ARENA_ENGINEERING_HANDOVER.md "Sandbox network constraints"
# section. This sandbox's egress proxy allowlists github.com,
# codeload.github.com and registry.npmjs.org, but NOT the
# githubusercontent.com asset CDN hosts used by prebuild-install to fetch
# precompiled native addon binaries (better-sqlite3), nor nodejs.org
# directly (node-gyp's fallback source for Node headers when no prebuild is
# available for the running Node ABI). Pointing node-gyp at the Node headers
# already installed locally by this sandbox's Node distribution avoids both
# network calls entirely.
nodedir=/usr/local
